.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-attestation 1  "oct-attestation " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-attestation \- Attestation management (Yubico only)
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct attestation\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Attestation management (Yubico only)
.PP
Yubico implements a proprietary extension to the OpenPGP card standard to cryptographically certify that a certain asymmetric key has been generated on device, and not imported.
.PP
This feature is available on YubiKey 5 devices with firmware version 5.2 or newer.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
oct\-attestation\-cert(1)
Print the card\*(Aqs attestation certificate
.TP
oct\-attestation\-generate(1)
Generate attestation statement for one of the key slots on the card
.TP
oct\-attestation\-statement(1)
Print the attestation statement for one of the key slots on the card
.TP
oct\-attestation\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
